  "status": "Refused",
  "actual_commencement_date": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;In summary the proposed removal of the chimneystacks would result in a significant loss of historic fabric which is without clear justification or wider public benefit. Additionally without evidence to the contrary the proposed internal structural works are unconfirmed to be the least harmful solution in ensuring less than substantial harm to the listed structure, whilst also securing its long-term viability. The proposal is considered to impact negatively on the character and setting of the listed building and is therefore contrary to the aims and objectives of Policy 71 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024), which seeks to ensure that development conserves and enhances any features of architectural interest.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
